                            </div>
                        </td>
                        <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap text-sm space-x-2">
                            <button class="bg-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded text-xs transition-colors duration-200" data-responsibilities='["Developed and maintained scalable APIs serving GPT models to millions of users", "Optimized inference performance across distributed systems and GPUs", "Built observability pipelines for monitoring latency, throughput, and model performance"]'>
                                Details
                            </button>
                            <button class="bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded text-xs transition-colors duration-200">
                                Edit
                            </button>
                            <button class="bg-red-500 hover:bg-red-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded text-xs transition-colors duration-200">
                                Delete
                            </button>
